        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lMu2XPO0y1B0d5oH1q_r-231" value="🔵 Diff Tracker&#xa;✅ Capability変化と前回配信値を比較&#xa;❌ 連続値の閾値判断はしない (それはFilter)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="lMu2XPO0y1B0d5oH1q_r-228" vertex="1">
